@baseUrl = http://localhost:62902

### Reject an invalid directory without changing existing settings (400).
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workingDirectory": "",
  "fileExtensionFilter": "*.nc"
}

### Confirm previous settings are unchanged after a rejected save.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings

### List the configured working directory.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files/children

### With C:\ configured on the Agent, a denied folder returns 403 Problem Details.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files/children?path=Config.Msi

### Missing directories return 404, with an error displayed in the file browser.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files/children?path=nonexistent-directory

### Paths outside the configured working directory return 400.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files/children?path=..%2F
